<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pages on Rizzykun</title><link>https://rizzykun.github.io/page/</link><description>Recent content in Pages on Rizzykun</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://rizzykun.github.io/page/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>About</title><link>https://rizzykun.github.io/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rizzykun.github.io/about/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/about/cover.png" alt="Featured image of post About" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="-welcome-to-my-ctf-writeups"&gt;&lt;a href="#-welcome-to-my-ctf-writeups" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🎉 Welcome to My CTF Writeups!
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there, Thanks for visiting my website 👋&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m &lt;strong&gt;Afiq&lt;/strong&gt; — Muhammad Afiq Danial bin Mohd Bacho, online as &lt;strong&gt;Rizzykun&lt;/strong&gt;.
Computer Science at IIUM, CTF challenge creator, based in Greater Kuala Lumpur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve finally decided to start documenting my &lt;strong&gt;CTF (Capture The Flag)&lt;/strong&gt; journey! 🚩
I&amp;rsquo;m still a beginner (yes, expect some failure moments 🤦), but that&amp;rsquo;s exactly why this page exists — to &lt;strong&gt;learn, share and laugh&lt;/strong&gt; along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-what-to-expect-here"&gt;&lt;a href="#-what-to-expect-here" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;💡 What to Expect Here
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writeups of CTF challenges I&amp;rsquo;ve solved 🕵️&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;My thought process (a.k.a. the chaos inside my head) 🤯&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lessons learned, mistakes made and &amp;ldquo;aha!&amp;rdquo; moments ✨&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Homelab builds and the things I break along the way 🖥️&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resources, tips and little tricks that I pick up 📚&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-why-im-doing-this"&gt;&lt;a href="#-why-im-doing-this" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🚀 Why I&amp;rsquo;m Doing This
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;CTFs can feel overwhelming at first, but they&amp;rsquo;re also &lt;strong&gt;super fun and addictive&lt;/strong&gt;.
By writing everything down, I can track my progress and maybe even help another beginner who&amp;rsquo;s just starting out. 🌱&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-competitions-so-far"&gt;&lt;a href="#-competitions-so-far" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🏁 Competitions so far
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thirteen and counting, from ICECTF in April 2025 to Sunway CTF in September
2026 — including finals at NEXSEC, iGOH, IBOH and Siber Siaga. The full record,
with results, certifications and talks, is on the
&lt;a class="link" href="https://rizzykun.github.io/timeline/" &gt;Track Record&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-final-words"&gt;&lt;a href="#-final-words" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;⚡ Final Words
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is just the beginning of my adventure.
So grab some popcorn 🍿, join me in the rabbit hole 🐇, and let&amp;rsquo;s see how deep we can go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Stay tuned for the next writeup — and remember:
&lt;strong&gt;Every flag is a small victory!&lt;/strong&gt; 🏁&lt;/p&gt;
