&lt;h2 id="writing"&gt;&lt;a href="#writing" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Writing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Short pieces I put on LinkedIn rather than here:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI is an accelerator, not a replacement for reasoning&lt;/strong&gt; (Aug 2026 *) — Reflection from the UCSI Agentic AI CTF on validating AI output and falling back on methodology when stuck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bad documentation, not difficulty, is what slows you down&lt;/strong&gt; (Jul 2026 *) — On restructuring security notes: separating concepts from commands, linking notes instead of nesting folders, and writing for your future self.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can&amp;rsquo;t be good at only red team or only blue team&lt;/strong&gt; (Dec 2025 *) — From NEXSEC 2025: why the two skill sets reinforce each other, and why report writing matters as much as technical skill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teammates across most of these: Mohammad Danish Hakim bin Mohd Nasir,
